MAINTENANCE OF THE WORK
========================

The Work has the status `maintained'.

The Current Maintainer of The Work is Julius Volland.

The Work consists of the files plankton.dtx and plankton.ins
and the derived files:
  plankton-base.sty
  plankton-electrical.sty
  plankton-plumbing.sty
  plankton-hvac.sty
  plankton-furniture.sty
  plankton-site.sty
